                                "sense_id": "77dd599e-6912-3e36-a0a1-43efeb8b3422",
                                "text": "Abd el Kader called them whoresons, ingle's accidents, sons of a bitch, profiteering cuckolds and pimps, jetting his insults broadcast to the roomfull."
